        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A donut (torus) in amigurumi is made as a stuffed tube joined end to end. Begin the tube with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-a64"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and crochet "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "working-in-the-round-a64"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "in the round"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The inner hole shaper is a smaller cylinder used to guide the final ring shape before joining."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Outer tube"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work the outer tube rows below. Leave both ends open for now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
